---
import NumberCard from "./NumberCard.astro";
---

<div class="card-container">
  <NumberCard number="01" title="Development & Maintenance">
    <h3 slot="subtitle">
      <span class="accent">Built</span> with <span class="accent">quality</span>
    </h3>
    <span class="description" slot="description">
      Do you have a vision you want to bring to life? Heckers Software is here
      to help you turn that vision into a reality. We offer comprehensive
      development and maintenance services tailored to your unique needs.

      <br />
      <br />

      From enterprise applications to innovative startups, our team of
      experienced developers is dedicated to delivering <span class="accent"
        >high-quality</span
      >
      solutions that exceed your expectations. We work closely with you throughout
      the development process to ensure that your project is delivered on time, within
      budget, and to your exact specifications.
    </span>
  </NumberCard>
  <NumberCard number="02" title="Angular & Nx Architecture Plan">
    <h3 slot="subtitle">
      <span class="accent">Improve</span> code <span class="accent"
        >structure</span
      >
    </h3>
    <span class="description" slot="description">
      Is the <span class="accent">velocity</span> of your front-end team
      <span class="accent">dropping</span> or your Nx monorepo becoming unmanageable?
      Are bugs and technical debt piling up faster than new features can be delivered?

      <br />
      <br />
      At Heckers Software, we specialize in Angular and Nx. We understand that a well-structured
      codebase is the foundation of any successful project. With our expertise, we
      analyze your codebase, architecture, and development processes to <span
        class="accent">identify areas for improvement</span
      >. Then, we provide a detailed report with actionable recommendations to
      enhance code quality, maintainability, and scalability.
    </span>
  </NumberCard>
  <NumberCard number="03" title="Front-end Workshops">
    <h3 slot="subtitle">
      <span class="accent">Improve</span> team's <span class="accent"
        >velocity</span
      >
    </h3>
    <span class="description" slot="description">
      Are you embracing a new technology or looking to <span class="accent"
        >boost</span
      >
      your front-end team's productivity and efficiency? Heckers Software offers specialized
      front-end workshops designed to enhance your team's
      <span class="accent">skills and knowledge</span>.

      <br />
      <br />

      Our workshops cover a range of topics, including best practices in
      front-end development, modern frameworks and libraries, performance
      optimization, and user experience design. We tailor our workshops to meet
      the specific needs of your team, ensuring that they receive practical,
      hands-on training that can be immediately applied to their work.
    </span>
  </NumberCard>
</div>

<style>
  .card-container {
    padding: var(--spacer-2xl);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
    grid-template-rows: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--spacer-2xl);
    justify-content: space-between;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .card-container :global(.card) {
    top: 15vh;
    position: sticky;
    animation-timeline: view();
    animation-range: entry 25vh cover 80vh;
    animation-fill-mode: forwards;
  }

  .description {
    font-family: var(--font-secondary);
  }

  :not(h3) > .accent {
    font-family: var(--font-secondary);
  }

  .accent {
    color: var(--color-danger);
  }

  .card-container :global(.card:nth-of-type(1)) {
    grid-row: 1;
    grid-column: 1;
  }

  .card-container :global(.card:nth-of-type(2)) {
    grid-row: 2;
    grid-column: 2;
  }

  .card-container :global(.card:nth-of-type(3)) {
    grid-row: 3;
    grid-column: 3;
  }
</style>
